{'symbol': 'NWL', 'date': '2022-04-04 09:22:00', 'title': 'CENTURY™ CELEBRATES ONE YEAR ANNIVERSARY BY RECOGNIZING NOTABLE BRAND MILESTONES', 'text': "SUSTAINABLE BABY BRAND REFLECTS ON ONE YEAR OF SUCCESSES AND ACCOMPLISHMENTS ATLANTA , APRIL 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CENTURY™, A MODERN-DAY BABY BRAND FEATURING BUDGET-FRIENDLY, SIMPLE AND SUSTAINABLE PRODUCTS IS CELEBRATING ITS FIRST BIRTHDAY THIS MONTH. IN HONOR OF EARTH MONTH AND THE BRAND'S ONE YEAR ANNIVERSARY, CENTURY IS REFLECTING ON MAJOR MILESTONES THROUGHOUT THE PAST YEAR."}